# The trait-script system gives each spawned character its own exec'd
# namespace (script_ns) whose functions close over that same namespace --
# a reference cycle. Cyclic garbage only gets freed by the gc module's
# periodic sweep, which triggers on an allocation-count heuristic and can
# land mid-frame, causing a stutter that looks "random". We turn that
# heuristic way down and instead collect explicitly at safe points
# (arena clear / sim restart) below.
gc.set_threshold(100000, 50, 50)

